{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1476242-who-is-the-most-powerful-canon-ahroun-npc","id":1476242,"title":"Who is the most powerful canon Ahroun npc?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-11T17:19:32-08:00","id":1476242,"title":"Who is the most powerful canon Ahroun npc?","content":"Who is the most powerful canon Ahroun npc?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-11T22:19:01-08:00","id":1476257,"title":"","content":"Maybe Golgol Fangs-First, legendary Get of Fenris Ahroun described in Rage Across Amazon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-11T22:57:11-08:00","id":1476260,"title":"","content":"Zhyzhak is probably the most personally powerful Ahroun in terms of a one-on-one fight that's detailed in the books. Jonas and Golgol are close (enough the Jonas and Zyzhak are likely to kill each other in their prophesized showdown), but at a disadvantage against her based on their published stats. Jonas and Golgol both have considerable political power and allies to call on in a more general idea of power. Jonas with the Silver Crown probably takes the top spot if we combine personal combat prowess with how much theoretical military might he can command if he calls in all of his chips; but Golgol and Zhyzhak both are no slouches here somewhat by virtue of being more respected leaders that already have large combat ready forces that follow them directly on hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T10:05:33-08:00","id":1476273,"title":"","content":"Zhyzhak<br /> Albrecht<br /> Golgol<br /> <br /> <br /> If we are talking about ''powerful'' as combat/social advantages/contatcs and renown as garou, most likely Golgol Fangfist , leader of entire paramilitary organizations of garou, and Anton Nordenskald, , right hand of queen Tamara Tvarivich and most renowed russian Fenris. I suppose this guy would have an immense influence in a very large territory. Arn Guth Stormbright is another guy with senseless stats to check out, in terms of raw homicidal skills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 03-12-2022, 01:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T10:39:47-08:00","id":1476274,"title":"","content":"Stated npcs are true, unstated\u2026 may have more choices. For example, Shu-Horus who made Set unmovable. Yuri and Sophia Tvarivich who killed Zmei and became the greatest Silver Fang ever. Most great ahrouns live in history","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T13:53:08-08:00","id":1476282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1476242-who-is-the-most-powerful-canon-ahroun-npc?p=1476273#post1476273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zhyzhak<br /> Albrecht<br /> Golgol<br /> <br /> <br /> If we are talking about ''powerful'' as combat/social advantages/contatcs and renown as garou, most likely Golgol Fangfist , leader of entire paramilitary organizations of garou, and Anton Nordenskald, , right hand of queen Tamara Tvarivich and most renowed russian Fenris. I suppose this guy would have an immense influence in a very large territory. Arn Guth Stormbright is another guy with senseless stats to check out, in terms of raw homicidal skills.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is thunders teeth not an ahroun? <br /> <br /> But yea zykzahk is in all ways the strongest ahroun. Strength 6? In homid, or something stupid like that. She\u2019s crinos strong normally. Also leads the armies of the wyrm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T14:09:16-08:00","id":1476283,"title":"","content":"Her Strength is so high because of her Totem. There's a few Gaian Totems that explicitly let you raise your Strength over 5 too. It's hardly the most impressive thing she's got going.<br /> <br /> How strong of a force she directly commands varies a bit, and unlike Golgol or Jonas, she's had to deal with two insurrections among her ranks (one from inside her own pack). Jonas also has loyalty problems, but he's technically the king of the entire Garou Nation which is something a lot of Garou don't like the idea of even if they think Jonas is a decent guy. Since obtaining the Silver Crown, nobody (at least as far as Rev/W20 have taken things) has actively tried to usurp him even if he has political rivals trying to work against them; they've consistently put defeating Wyrm threats over such plans in the end. Golgol definitely has the strongest loyalty among the forces that follow him, and the best structure to deal with what would happen if he fell in battle.<br /> <br /> So, again, &quot;power&quot; is one of those words that makes this hard because power can mean a lot of different things.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T14:24:37-08:00","id":1476285,"title":"","content":"Well going off the canon end of the world per revised, she leads the entire army of the wyrm in the end days. That\u2019s not insubstantial.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T15:00:25-08:00","id":1476286,"title":"","content":"By that, Jonas is leading the entire army of Gaia in the end days too...and if he uses his Gift to enter a one-on-one duel with her, it's to the Gaian force's benefit because if they both die, Jonas becomes a martyr the Gaian's rally behind, and Zhyzhak's death splinters the Wyrm's army without her to enforce order on it.<br /> <br /> When we're talking about military leadership as a form of power, this sort of thing matters. An army that's too dependent on the leader to function is at a serious disadvantage to one that can endure being decapitated; esp. when you're talking about leaders that engage in battle directly and can try to arrange for showdowns between themselves and their opposing general.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T19:59:54-08:00","id":1476307,"title":"","content":"If it\u2019s personally greatest, Perfect M\u00e9tis and First Metis may have some place(although latter has been omitted in W20)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Perfect Metis, Possessed Black Spiral Dancer<br /> Breed: Metis<br /> Auspice: Ahroun<br /> Tribe: Black Spiral Dancer<br /> Physical: Strength 8(10/12/11/9), Dexterity 6(6/7/8/8), Stamina 8(10/11/11/10)<br /> Social: Charisma 5, Manipulation 4(3/1/1/1), Appearance 5(4/0/5/5)<br /> Mental: Perception 5, Intelligence 4, Wits 5<br /> Talents: Alertness 5, Athletics 5, Brawl 5, Dodge 5, Intimidation 5<br /> Skills: Leadership 5, Melee 5<br /> Knowledges: Enigmas 5, Occult 5, Rituals 5<br /> Backgrounds: Allies 5, Consecrated 5,Fetish 5, Rites 5, Symbiosis 5<br /> Gifts: (1) Bane Protector, Inspiration, Sense Wyrm<br /> (2) Horns of the Impaler, Spirit of the Fray, Wyrm Hide<br /> (3) Combat Healing, Dagger of the Mind<br /> (4) Open Wounds, Stoking Fury's Furnace<br /> (5) Avatar of the Wyrm<br /> Powers: Enhanced Attributes (+3 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +3 Stamina), Horror (supernatural version), Sense Gaia, Thick Skin x5, Triatic Sense, Voice of the Wyrm<br /> Rage 10, Gnosis 10, Willpower 10<br /> Rites: As appropriate.<br /> Fetishes: As appropriate.<br /> Merits and Flaws: Huge Size, Iron Will<br /> Taints: None </div> </div> </div>His superhuman Physical coms from possessed powers.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The First Ronin/The First Metis<br /> <br /> Breed: Metis<br /> Auspice: Ahroun<br /> Tribe: Unknown<br /> Physical: Strength 7(9/11/10/8), Dexterity 6(6/7/8/8), Stamina 5(7/8/8/7)<br /> Social: Charisma 0, Manipulation 0(0/0/0/0), Appearance 0(0/0/0/0)<br /> Mental: Perception 5, Intelligence 4, Wits 5<br /> Talents: Alertness 5, Athletics 5, Brawl5, Dodge 5, Intimidation 5, Primal-Urge 5, Subterfuge 5<br /> Skills: Animal Ken 5, Melee 5, Stealth 5, Survival 5, Enigmas 5<br /> Knowledges: Linguistics 5, Occult 5, Rituals 5<br /> Backgrounds: Mentor 10 (if the legends are true, the First Ronin's Mentor is the Wyrm), Personal Totem 10 (the Wyrm)<br /> Gifts: All Gifts of the Garou tribes, including those of the Black Spiral Dancers, up to and including the 4th level (be afraid, be very afraid), Fearful Flight (for one Gnosis point, the Ronin can make all Garou present flee with a resisted Strength + Intimidation roll against the opponents' Rage) </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}